<title>ITALY: TENNIS-SICILIAN CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SICILIAN CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PALERMO, Sicily 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sicilian international </p>
<p>championships results on Saturday:</p>
<p>Quarter-final (played Friday):</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>Alami beat Marzio Martelli (Italy) 6-3 1-6 6-2</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat Johan Van Herck (Belgium) 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
